OL,3,APeople playing loud music on buses
OL,4,Acould face #100 fine
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers who play loud music on buses
OL,7,Fin England could be fined up to #100
OL,8,Funder an attempt by the government to
OL,9,Fcrack down on antisocial behaviour.
OL,11,FThe measures also seek to tackle
OL,12,Flittering, vaping and threatening
OL,13,Fbehaviour to help improve journeys on
OL,14,Fall forms of public transport.
OL,16,FOffenders on buses could be issued with
OL,17,Fthe fines under new powers for local
OL,18,Fauthorities.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
