OL,3,APeople playing loud music on buses
OL,4,Acould face #100 fine
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere have been laws against playing
OL,7,Floud music, as well as singing, on
OL,8,Ftrains since 2005 but the government
OL,9,Fwill remind rail passengers of this
OL,10,Fwith the launch of a national campaign
OL,11,Fasking people to "share the carriage,
OL,12,Fnot the noise".
